'''Delcatty''' (Japanese: '''エネコロロ''' ''Enekororo'') is a {{ct|Colorless}} Stage 1 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Mega Rising}} expansion.

