==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Celestial Storm|Delcatty|121}} from the {{TCG|Celestial Storm}} expansion; both cards have the Search for Friends Ability and the Cat Kick attack.
*'''Search for Friends''' is an {{TCG|Ability}} that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Celestial Storm|Delcatty|121}} from the {{TCG|Celestial Storm}} expansion.
*'''Cat Kick''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Gym Challenge|Giovanni's Meowth|74}} from the {{TCG|Gym Challenge}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Y}}.

